{"overview":"The daring convict no. 23, known as The Eel, escapes from prison and, after mocking his inept persecutors, saves the lives of three people in peril: a beautiful girl, her mother and an annoying suitor, only to get exhausted and almost drowned. Once he regains his strength at Judge Brown's home, he participates on an upper-class social party where he competes with the suitor for the favors of the charming Miss Brown. But prison guards are still after him…","cast":[{"n":"Charlie Chaplin","c":"The Eel / Commodore Slick","p":"/lRI9Ky1SMOehn04OqhYJ5hQfgIK.jpg","q":"Q882"},{"n":"Edna Purviance","c":"Miss Brown - The Girl","p":"/qGAhDLNl9YjTdds73hhgOo2NLf7.jpg","q":null},{"n":"Eric Campbell","c":"The Suitor","p":"/3W1EWAYSFNe7yKhMs7Oyp3bodDM.jpg","q":"Q1333440"},{"n":"Henry Bergman","c":"Judge Brown - The Father / Docker","p":"/x41Z1XOGnBg6xnFhxunVQBmcJ36.jpg","q":"Q718451"},{"n":"Albert Austin","c":"The Butler","p":"/4NjPns56oHuoH0BVmI9oW4pMAmV.jpg","q":"Q1137229"},{"n":"Marta Golden","c":"Mrs. Brown - The Mother","p":null,"q":null},{"n":"Toraichi Kono","c":"Chauffeur (uncredited)","p":null,"q":null},{"n":"Phyllis Allen","c":"Governess (uncredited)","p":null,"q":"Q1073112"},{"n":"John Rand","c":"Party Guest (uncredited)","p":"/hVv5NHtoCvIPX7V4eYTj78cEzdF.jpg","q":null},{"n":"Loyal Underwood","c":"Party Guest (uncredited)","p":"/4CvOMza51WCJZIgOPfzejA3K4h9.jpg","q":null}],"country":["United States"],"language":["English"],"wiki":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/The_Adventurer_(1917_film)","qid":"Q1192082","rel":{"ES":{"d":"1919-02-21"},"MX":{"d":"2013-09-17","c":"A"},"SU":{"d":"1958-07-06"},"US":{"d":"1917-10-22"}},"backdrops":["/pfQlIYdUiIef4CJDBwsWqrB52dr.jpg"],"mk":{"ti":30,"src":"frames"}}